---
pagination:
  data: softwareIndex.products
  size: 1
  alias: p
  # Zonder dit komt alleen de eerste pagina van de reeks in collections.all,
  # en dus maar een van de 72 in sitemap.xml.
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
permalink: "/software/{{ p.id }}/"
layout: layout.njk
excludeFromLlms: true
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ p.name }}"
  seo_title: "{{ p.name }}: What It Does, Pricing and Alternatives | Tubes"
  description: "{{ p.name }} by {{ p.vendor }}. {{ p.summary }}"
---
{#- Een eigen pagina per softwareproduct. Alles komt uit wat de leverancier zelf
    publiceert; prijzen staan er zoals gepubliceerd of helemaal niet. Tubes staat
    er als gewoon product tussen, met dezelfde velden als de rest. -#}
<article class="section theme-light company-page">
  <div class="container company-inner has-promo">
    <div class="company-main">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <a href="/">Home</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="/software/">Software</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <a href="{{ p.categoryUrl }}">{{ p.category }}</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page">{{ p.name }}</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="company-head">
      <p class="company-kicker"><a href="{{ p.categoryUrl }}">{{ p.category }}</a></p>
      <h1>{{ p.name }}</h1>
      <p class="company-where">
        {{ p.vendor }}{% if p.vendor_country %}<span>,</span> {% if p.countryUrl %}<a href="{{ p.countryUrl }}">{{ p.vendor_country }}</a>{% else %}{{ p.vendor_country }}{% endif %}{% endif %}
        <span class="loc-tag">{{ p.deployment }}</span>
      </p>
      <p class="company-summary">{{ p.summary }}</p>
      <p class="company-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="{{ p.official_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">Visit {{ p.name }}</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/compare-media-software/">Compare with others</a>
      </p>
    </header>
    {#- Reclameblok: op smalle schermen hier, anders in de zijkolom onderaan. -#}
    {% set promoVariant = "inline" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}

    <h2>What {{ p.name }} does</h2>
    <table class="company-facts">
      <tbody>
        <tr><th scope="row">Category</th><td><a href="{{ p.categoryUrl }}">{{ p.category }}</a>{% for a in p.alsoIn %}{% if loop.first %}, also listed in {% else %} and {% endif %}<a href="{{ a.url }}">{{ a.name | lower }}</a>{% endfor %}</td></tr>
        {%- if p.for_whom %}<tr><th scope="row">Built for</th><td>{{ p.for_whom | capitalize_first }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
        <tr><th scope="row">Pricing</th><td>{{ p.pricing_model }}</td></tr>
        <tr><th scope="row">Deployment</th><td>{{ p.deployment }}</td></tr>
        {%- if p.platforms %}<tr><th scope="row">Platforms</th><td>{{ p.platforms }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
        {%- if p.integrations %}<tr><th scope="row">Integrations</th><td>{{ p.integrations }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
        <tr><th scope="row">Vendor</th><td>{{ p.vendor }}{% if p.vendor_country %}, {{ p.vendor_country }}{% endif %}</td></tr>
        {%- if p.founded %}<tr><th scope="row">Since</th><td>{{ p.founded }}</td></tr>{% endif %}
        <tr><th scope="row">Website</th><td><a href="{{ p.official_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">{{ p.official_url | replace("https://", "") | replace("http://", "") }}</a></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="company-note">
      Only what {{ p.vendor }} publishes itself is listed here, checked on {{ softwareIndex.updated }}. Pricing is quoted as published; where a vendor does not publish a price, it says so. This directory is published by Tubes, which is
      {% if p.isTubes %}the maker of this product{% else %}listed in it as well, under <a href="/software/tubes/">Tubes</a>{% endif %}.
    </p>

    {%- if p.sameVendor.length %}
    <h2>Also from {{ p.vendor }}</h2>
    {% set lijst = p.sameVendor %}{% set toonCategorie = true %}{% set meer = 0 %}
    {% include "partials/software-links.njk" %}
    {%- endif %}

    {%- if p.alternatives.length %}
    <h2>Alternatives to {{ p.name }}</h2>
    <p>Other software in {{ p.categoriesText }}. {{ p.categoryBlurb }} Put three of them side by side in the <a href="/compare-media-software/">comparison tool</a>.</p>
    {% set lijst = p.alternatives %}{% set toonCategorie = false %}{% set toonDeployment = true %}
    {% set meer = p.alternativesMore %}{% set meerUrl = p.categoryUrl %}
    {% set meerLabel = "All " + p.category | lower + " software" %}
    {% include "partials/software-links.njk" %}
    {%- endif %}

    <p class="company-back">
      <a href="{{ p.categoryUrl }}">All {{ p.category | lower }} software</a> &middot;
      <a href="/software/">Software directory</a> &middot;
      <a href="/compare-media-software/">Search all {{ softwareIndex.total }} products</a>
    </p>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-side">{% set promoVariant = "aside" %}{% include "partials/company-promo.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</article>

<section class="section theme-teal">
  <div class="container company-cta">
    <h2>{% if p.isTubes %}See Tubes in your own production{% else %}Working in production?{% endif %}</h2>
    <p>Tubes brings budgeting, planning and cost control together in one platform, connected to the accounting system you already use.</p>
    <p><a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Request a Demo</a> <a class="button button-secondary" href="/compare-media-software/">Back to the search</a></p>
  </div>
</section>
